SUMMARY:THE SEMINOLE TRIBE OF FLORIDA — Call #4
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: THE SEMINOLE TRIBE OF FLORIDA\nRoadshow: https://dealroadshow.fins
 ight.com/e/STOF2026 OR https://dealroadshow.finsight.com\; Entry Code: STO
 F2026\n\nDeal context:\nThe Seminole Tribe of Florida (rated Baa2/BBB/BBB 
 with Stable outlooks across all three agencies)\, a federally recognized s
 overeign tribe operating Seminole Gaming\, has mandated Barclays\, BofA Se
 curities\, SMBC Nikko Securities\, and US Bancorp to arrange investor upda
 te calls ahead of a potential offering of Senior Secured Gaming Administra
 tion Notes under Rule 144A/Reg S without registration rights. The deal is 
 at the Mandate stage\, with investor calls scheduled for September 8-9\, 2
 026\, accompanied by a preliminary offering memorandum and pre-recorded el
 ectronic investor presentation\; no size\, tenor\, or pricing terms have b
 een disclosed. The offering may follow subject to market conditions\, repr
 esenting the tribe's return to the capital markets with a senior secured s
 tructure backed by its gaming operations.
